Wrote the label file for John Kavanagh / school-vouchers. The only sources available (HB2853 co-sponsorship, enacted text, and House Third Reading vote) all date to Kavanagh's 2022 Arizona House service — before and outside the State Senate term (2023-01-02–present) this row codes. Under V5, a record from an earlier office is valid for that office only, so despite the enacted text matching universal ESA (rung 5) clause for clause, none of it can establish a chair for the Senate seat. Coded all three passages fully (own-act/on-question/record/chair-shaped/pre-seating) but the row resolves to `v6_blank_reason: "no-evidence"` with empty `rests_on`, and I flagged `needs_source` for Senate-era evidence.
